                <pb facs="0895" n="783" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg783"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.24/479: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Commission to Negotiate
                        Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-29T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 29,
                                1919—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3595. Your 4828, October 26, 3 a.m.</p>
                <p>Did “Ukrainian Republic” pay cash? If not what terms and security? See in this
                    connection Department’s telegram of even date concerning our general policy in
                    respect to the Ukraine.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
